# Line endings
#
# The repository already stores every text file with LF; this pins that so a
# contributor without core.autocrlf set cannot commit CRLF and turn a one-line
# edit into a whole-file diff. Working copies still check out with the
# platform's native endings, so Windows editors are unaffected.
* text=auto

# Declared explicitly rather than left to content heuristics.
*.js    text
*.json  text
*.html  text
*.css   text
*.md    text
*.yml   text
*.svg   text
*.txt   text

# Never normalized, never diffed as text. The database patterns are a safety
# net only — the live store lives outside the repo and .gitignore already
# refuses these — but a corrupted binary is not a recoverable mistake.
*.ico    binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.gif    binary
*.webp   binary
*.exe    binary
*.db     binary
*.sqlite binary

# Vendored third-party code (Quill, DOMPurify). Excluded from GitHub's language
# statistics and collapsed in diffs, so the language bar reflects this app's own
# code rather than two minified libraries.
renderer/vendor/** linguist-vendored

# Generated by npm, not hand-authored.
package-lock.json linguist-generated
